-----------------------------------------------------
 This is the flowchart of payu clone interactive mode. 
 Please press 'q' to return to the Payu Clone Wizard.
-----------------------------------------------------
                +==================+
                |    payu clone    |
                +==================+
                        |
                        v
        +=====================================+
        | Enter the URL of the targeted repo  |
        +=====================================+
                        |
                        v
         /=========================================\
        / Clone from a branch, a tag, or a commit?  \
       /=============================================\
        |                               |
     branch                         tag or commit
        |                               |
        v                               v
+=====================+         +=====================+
| Enter branch name   |         | Enter tag or commit |
+=====================+         +=====================+
        |                                :
        +-------------+   +..............+
                      |   :
                      v   v
        +======================================+
        | Name your local experiment directory |
        +======================================+
                |                       :
                v                       :
  /======================\              : 
 /  Is this a new expt?   \----------+  :
/==========================\         |  :
           |                         |  :
           No                       Yes :
           |                         |  :
           |                         v  v
           |                      +======================+
           |                      | Name your new branch |
           |                      +======================+
           |                               |
           |                               v
           L>   /=========================\
               /  Do you want to specify   \
              /      a restart path?        \
             /===============================\
            |                                |
            Yes                              No
            |                                |
+========================+                   |
|  Ask for restart path  |                   |
+========================+                   |
            |                                |
            v                                v
            +--------------+-----------------+
                           |
                           v
                 /=====================\
                /  Override shortpath?  \ 
               /=========================\
                |                        |
                Yes                      No
                |                        |
+========================+               |
|  Ask for new shortpath |               |
+========================+               |
                |                        |
                v                        v
                +------------+-----------+
                             v
                      +==============+
                      |   Run clone  |
                      +==============+

-----------------------------------------------------
 Press 'q' to return to the Payu Clone Wizard.
